     1000   DEFINE VARIABLE iv AS LOGICAL INITIAL yes
     1001        LABEL "приход перемещение":L
     1002        VIEW-AS TOGGLE-BOX
     1003        SIZE 27.63 BY .75 NO-UNDO.
     1004   DEFINE VARIABLE ost-1 AS LOGICAL INITIAL no
